A||||23||FOCONE||Reminder OOB, ME Show||||10||
Z||000000||FOCONE||05-14-2001||07:31 PM||||I just wanted to let everyone know that the pre-registration date for the FOCONE Old Orchard Beach Summer show being held on the dates of June 15-16, 2001 is rapidly coming to a close.  After May 30, 2001 the registration fee increases.  So if you are planning on going be sure to get your registration in the mail soon.<P>If you need a registration form please feel free to contact Chris Schaefer at chris.schaefer@focone.org .<P>We are also going to have a awards banquet pizza party the evening after the show.<P>HOTEL INFORMATION<BR>Cross Winds Cottages & Motels<BR>142 East Grand Avenue<BR>Old Orchard Beach, ME<BR>Phone 207-934-4062 or 1-800-853-4062<P>FOCONE SHOW HOTEL RATES<BR>$40.00 per night or $75.00 for a two consecutive night stay, up to four people.  <BR>When you make your reservations, you must ask for the Fiero Show rate.  <BR>Also, book your rooms early, as the rooms will fill up fast.<BR>The motel is located about 1-mile from the show grounds.<P>WEEKEND SCHEDULE<P>Friday:<BR>1pm - 8pm is Registration and Tech-1 session at One Fiero Drive.<P>Saturday:<BR>8:30am - Noon is open registration for the show and also for the evenings banquet.  Also you can clean and shine your car and place it on the show field.<P>11:00 am till 1:30pm is the time to look over everyone's cars and place your votes.  Also, at you leisure, you can take a break for lunch, refreshments and more Fiero talk.<P>3:00pm Relax and talk or take a walk on the beach or take a cruise to Kennebunkport.<P>6:30pm until... Banquet at One Fiero Drive.  All you can eat Pizza plain, pepperoni, etc. all you can drink Pepsi diet/Pepsi root beer 7 Up and for desert a Fiero sheet cake.<P>Sunday:<BR>This day is up to you.<P>SHOW CLASSES<BR>1984 1st 2nd <BR>1985 1st 2nd <BR>1986 1st 2nd 3rd<BR>1987 1st 2nd 3rd<BR>1988  1st 2nd 3rd 4th<BR>T-Top Class 1st 2nd 3rd<BR>Best 100% original Fiero<BR>Best Display of Paint/Decals<BR>Best Rebody<BR>Most ratty Fiero<BR>Modified<BR>Best engine conversion<BR>Best Reconstructed Fiero<BR>Best of show<BR>Most Miles Driven to the Show in a Fiero<BR>President Choice Award<P>I hope everyone can attend.<P>Thank you.<P>Chris Schaefer<BR>FOCONE Membership Director/Editor<BR>Chris.schaefer@focone.org<p>[This message has been edited by FOCONE (edited 05-25-2001).]||||reg||10
Z||000001||FOCONE||05-25-2001||10:46 PM||||Pre-Registration ends May 31st.||||reg||4
