Z||000003||Fiero5||05-26-2001||07:01 PM||||We have our 4 registrations in already.<BR>The Fieros we are planning on bringing are:<BR>Steve (Fiero9-red 86 SS), Marian (Fiero2-a secret surprise), son Stephen (Slang-highliter yellow w/purple trim 85 GT) and my Dad Russ (stock maroon 87 GT).<BR>The Kelley's are looking forward to the awesome OOB show!<P>See you all there.<P>Steve<P>P.S. Love the two FOCONE newsletters to date!<P>------------------<BR>                        <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fiero9supersig_1.jpg">                      <BR>http://www.kelleyfamilyfieros.homestead.com/index.html||||reg||12
