Z||000016||FOCONE||06-04-2001||09:12 PM||||Hey Steve,<P>I am unclear as to where you would have heard such grumbling <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">.  Seeing as I am one of the top people hwo are working to make the show possible, you can rest assure that as long as we have phone numbers and addresses we will get the trophies to those who may not be able to stay for the awards.  If I have to I will see to it myself.  After all, it is a good excuse to mail out another membership form. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>To answer your question Tweek, if you are not entering a car then you do not have to register for the show.  However, if you want to go to the banquet, then you would have to pay for that($11.00 All you can eat Pizza, soda and cake).<P>Later,<P>Chris Schaefer<BR>FOCONE Membership Director/Editor||||reg||6
