Z||000020||FOCONE||06-14-2001||09:53 PM||||Nice weather is on tap for Fri and Sat. this show will be the biggest ever!<P>We have just heard from the owner of the Cross Winds Cottages & Motels that they are now full.  So, If you are planning on attending and have not yet made reservations then the feel free to contact The Americana Hotel at 207-934-2292.  Unfortunately there are no show rates set for this hotel.  However, some of you may remember that the Americana is located very close to the show field.<P>DON'T MISS OUT!  See you all there!<p>[This message has been edited by FOCONE (edited 06-14-2001).]||||reg||1
