Z||000022||Phil||06-15-2001||04:34 PM||||I'm leaving here in about 1 hr. Need a quick answer. "Where is the show?" All I know is Old Orchard Beach.||||reg||1
Z||000023||Tweek||06-15-2001||10:46 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Phil:<BR><B>I'm leaving here in about 1 hr. Need a quick answer. "Where is the show?" All I know is Old Orchard Beach.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I realize this is a bit late, but just in case, or for anyone else...<P>There is only 1 major highway entering Maine from the rest of the states. Take it. I95 North. Take exit #5 and follow I195 for about 2-3 miles... then follow directions on map located here.  <A HREF="http://www.oswg.net/Ted/Misc/oobmedir.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://www.oswg.net/Ted/Misc/oobmedir.jpg</A> <BR>This was taked from the pre-registration form for the even, if anyone objects to this being provided, please let me know and I will remove it. See ya tomorrow.||||reg||1
